%% Main paint frame sequence
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  participant Surface as CanvasSurface
  participant Frame as FrameEngine
  participant ViewCamera as Runtime view camera
  participant Facts as FrameFactsPort
  participant Store as DocumentStoreKernel
  participant Resources as ResourceKernel
  participant SelectionFacts as SelectionFactsPort
  participant Preview as CanvasPreviewState
  participant Spatial as SpatialKernel
  participant PlanCache as PaintPlanCache
  participant Session as SurfaceResourceSession
  participant Resolver as CanvasResourceResolver
  participant Painter as Main painter

  Surface->>Frame: paint main scene request(viewportRect, devicePixelRatio, gridStyle, selectionStyle, SurfaceResourceSession)
  Frame->>Facts: capture committed frame facts once
  Facts->>Store: read committed revision facts
  Store-->>Facts: documentRevision, structuralRevision, boundsRevision, elementVisualRevision, backgroundRevision, gridRevision
  Facts-->>Frame: immutable committed frame facts
  Frame->>Resources: capture resource visual facts once
  Resources-->>Frame: resourceVisualRevision
  Frame->>ViewCamera: capture runtime view camera facts once
  ViewCamera-->>Frame: viewCameraRevision and viewCameraOffset
  Frame->>SelectionFacts: capture selected ids and selectionRevision once
  SelectionFacts-->>Frame: selectionRevision and selectionIds
  Frame->>Frame: build CapturedMainFrame with viewportRect, devicePixelRatio, gridStyle.strokeWidth, and selectionStyle from paint request
  Frame->>Preview: capture CanvasSelectedMovePreview once
  Preview-->>Frame: delta or CanvasNoPreview
  Note over Frame: CapturedMainFrame freezes the runtime facts used by this main paint frame.

  Frame->>PlanCache: lookup ordinary paint plan by structural, bounds, elementVisual, viewportRect, and devicePixelRatio
  Note over Frame,PlanCache: PaintPlanCache excludes backgroundRevision, gridRevision, viewCameraRevision, viewCameraOffset, selectionRevision, selected ids, selectedMoveDelta, previewDelta, and style-only inputs.

  alt ordinary paint plan cache hit
    PlanCache-->>Frame: ordinary committed RenderElementRecord list
  else paint plan cache miss
    Frame->>Spatial: query paint candidates bounded by captured viewportRect
    Spatial-->>Frame: ordinary candidate handles with id, generation, orderToken, and structuralRevision

    loop for each ordinary candidate handle
      Frame->>Facts: resolve handle against captured structuralRevision and generation
      Facts->>Store: read committed row snapshot
      alt handle generation and structuralRevision still match the captured frame
        Store-->>Facts: immutable family row view, common paint fields, and resourceId if any
        Facts-->>Frame: immutable committed row facts
        Frame->>Frame: build ordinary committed RenderElementRecord
      else stale candidate
        Store-->>Facts: reject stale candidate
        Facts-->>Frame: stale candidate rejection
        Frame->>Frame: skip record for stale generation or structuralRevision
      end
    end

    Frame->>PlanCache: store ordinary committed records only
  end

  opt selectedMoveDelta is active
    Frame->>Frame: filter movable selected ids from ordinary records for this frame
    Frame->>Spatial: query selected supplement using visibilityRect shifted by -selectedMoveDelta
    Spatial-->>Frame: selected candidate handles with id, generation, orderToken, and structuralRevision
    loop for each selected supplement candidate handle
      Frame->>Facts: resolve handle against captured structuralRevision and generation
      Facts->>Store: read committed selected row snapshot
      Store-->>Facts: immutable selected row view or stale rejection
      Facts-->>Frame: selected row facts or stale rejection
      Frame->>Frame: build per-frame supplement RenderElementRecord with previewDelta
    end
    Frame->>Frame: merge filtered ordinary records and supplement records by orderToken
    Note over Frame,PlanCache: Selected supplement records are per-frame and are not stored in PaintPlanCache.
  end

  Note over Frame: No full-scene sort and no CanvasDocument materialization.
  Note over Frame,SelectionFacts: Selection decoration and selected move supplements are per-frame render concerns outside the ordinary PaintPlanCache.

  opt records include image resource ids
    loop for each image resource id in records
      Frame->>Facts: read descriptor facts by resourceId
      Facts->>Store: read descriptor facts from committed state
      Store-->>Facts: appKey descriptor, resourceRevision, or missing descriptor
      Facts-->>Frame: immutable descriptor facts or missing descriptor
      Frame->>Session: resolve paint asset(descriptor snapshot, resourceRevision)

      alt cached resolved image is current
        Session-->>Frame: app-owned image paint asset
      else descriptor missing or resolver returns null
        Session-->>Frame: bounded missing image placeholder
      else per-frame resolver budget exceeded
        Session-->>Frame: bounded placeholder, no null/missing cache write
      else cache miss and resolver budget available
        Session->>Resolver: resolveImage(appKey descriptor)
        Resolver-->>Session: app-owned image or null
        Session-->>Frame: resolved image or bounded placeholder
      end
    end
  end

  Frame->>Painter: paint immutable records, resolved assets, and bounded frame render caches
  Note over Frame,Painter: Ordinary element and stroke opacity is applied through primitive paint alpha. It must not call Canvas.saveLayer in the hot ordinary opacity path.
  Note over Frame,Painter: Any future saveLayer-producing effect must be explicit in RenderElementRecord, budgeted, counted by the frame.paint_candidates offscreen-layer metric, and guarded by a contract update before implementation.
  Painter-->>Surface: draw main scene

  Note over Painter: Painter consumes immutable RenderElementRecord data only, it performs no live runtime reads.
  Note over Frame,Store: Forbidden in main paint: direct FrameEngine store reads, Store mutation, CanvasDocument projection, DocumentProjectionCache read, public API reads, and InteractionEngine mutation.
  Note over Session,Resolver: SurfaceResourceSession owns synchronous app resolver calls, painter never calls the application resolver directly.
  Note over Surface,Painter: No legacy scene, controller, snapshot, or public DTO entities participate in this sequence.
